      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>The] testimony which to[ok pla]ce before us, we, the undersigned witnesses to this deed [of appointment]:\u00a0</li>\n<li>Sitt\u016bna bt. \u1e24ayy\u012bm b. Solomon, known as al-Ra\u1e25b\u012b, m)ay he rest in) p(eace), came before us\u00a0</li>\n<li>and said: \u201cKnow, my lords, that several years ago my husband, R. Fara\u1e25, known as Sur\u016br b. Joseph, m)ay he rest in) p(eace),\u00a0</li>\n<li>known as Ben B\u0101n\u016bqa, walked out and abandoned me naked, bare and without maintenance. I was left a forlorn aguna, a widow\u00a0</li>\n<li>of the living. I have nothing in my hands after he sold some of my dowry and pawned the rest. Years have already passed [...]\u00a0</li>\n<li>Now my lords, be my witnesses and make the symbolic purchase from me, as of now, and write and sign</li></ol>\n\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
